1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
That view on China's 20-yuan note? You can sail through it.
20元背面的风景，能坐船穿过

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,400
My route starts in Guilin, on the Li River.
路线从桂林漓江出发

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,800
83 km of karst peaks down to Yangshuo.
到阳朔，83公里喀斯特山水

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,200
Take a bamboo raft to Xingping — the banknote view.
竹筏到兴坪，纸币同款

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
Watch for cormorant fishermen — a fading 1,000-year craft.
鸬鹚渔夫，千年老手艺

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Then drift on to Yangshuo's old West Street.
再顺流到阳朔西街

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
Reward stop: Guilin rice noodles, a Qin-dynasty recipe.
奖励站：桂林米粉，秦代方子

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,600
Double-tap if you'd raft this river.
想坐竹筏的点个赞

10
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,400
★ Expert Tip: raft at dawn — you get the mist and beat the crowds.
内行提示：清晨坐筏，有雾又没人

11
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:26,000
Big cruise or bamboo raft — which would you pick?
大船还是竹筏？评论区见
